    "transcript": {
        "duration": 34.470001220703125,
        "text": "Claude has just introduced watermarking for text outputs. Claude AI will now embed watermarks and generate text to comply with regulations. Anthropic has announced that future versions of Claude will include a watermark in all generated text. This watermark is designed to comply with the EU AI Act and does not claim ownership over use-generated content. Concerns have risen regarding the potential impact on SEO and content originality, but Anthropic assures that the watermark serves as a compliance measure rather than a means of tracking individual users. The watermarking process aims to enhance transparency in AI-generated content.",
